<title>UK: NatWest appoints Harnett to Europe strategy.</title>
<headline>NatWest appoints Harnett to Europe strategy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>NatWest Markets has appointed the former chief economist at Societe Generale Strauss Turnbull, Ian Harnett as head of European strategy, a source at Natwest said.</p>
<p>Harnett was one of the few UK analysts to forecast that the FT-SE 100 index of leading British shares would burst through the 4,000 point level.</p>
<p>No-one at NatWest was available to comment officially. -- David Chance London newsroom 44 171 542 5887</p>
